! Curves: ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes (DataSets/Chillers.idf). Valid range of the curve set: leaving CHW
! 6.11-10.0 C, leaving condenser water 26.77-41.11 C, PLR 0.29-1.02. EnergyPlus clamps curve
! inputs to these limits; models/summarize_dc_run.py counts the hours outside them.
! Reference capacity hard-sized to the base model's autosized 552 kW (at the curve reference
! 6.11 C CHW / 34.8 C leaving condenser): E+ would autosize it as design load / CAPFT(design)
! = 482 kW, and SequentialUniformPLR stages on reference capacity, so 2 x 482 kW < peak load
! would start the standby chiller for ~2,500 h/yr. Condenser flow hard-sized = cooler flow.
  Chiller:Electric:ReformulatedEIR,
    Chiller 1,                          !- Name
    552000,                             !- Reference Capacity
    5.38,                               !- Reference COP
    6.11,                               !- Reference Leaving Chilled Water Temperature
    34.80,                              !- Reference Leaving Condenser Water Temperature
    autosize,                           !- Reference Chilled Water Flow Rate
    0.02797,                            !- Reference Condenser Water Flow Rate
    ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes CAPFT,!- Cooling Capacity Function of Temperature Curve Name
    ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes EIRFT,!- Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Temperature Curve Name
    LeavingCondenserWaterTemperature,   !- Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Part Load Ratio Curve Type
    ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes EIRFPLR,!- Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Part Load Ratio Curve Name
    0.29,                               !- Minimum Part Load Ratio
    1.02,                               !- Maximum Part Load Ratio
    1.0,                                !- Optimum Part Load Ratio
    0.29,                               !- Minimum Unloading Ratio
    Chiller 1 CHW Inlet,                !- Chilled Water Inlet Node Name
    Chiller 1 CHW Outlet,               !- Chilled Water Outlet Node Name
    Chiller 1 CW Inlet,                 !- Condenser Inlet Node Name
    Chiller 1 CW Outlet,                !- Condenser Outlet Node Name
    1.0,                                !- Fraction of Compressor Electric Consumption Rejected by Condenser
    2.0,                                !- Leaving Chilled Water Lower Temperature Limit
    LeavingSetpointModulated,           !- Chiller Flow Mode Type
    0,                                  !- Design Heat Recovery Water Flow Rate
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Inlet Node Name
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Outlet Node Name
    0.5,                                !- Sizing Factor
    ,                                   !- Condenser Heat Recovery Relative Capacity Fraction
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Inlet High Temperature Limit Schedule Name
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Leaving Temperature Setpoint Node Name
    Chillers;                           !- End-Use Subcategory

  Chiller:Electric:ReformulatedEIR,
    Chiller 2,                          !- Name
    552000,                             !- Reference Capacity
    5.38,                               !- Reference COP
    6.11,                               !- Reference Leaving Chilled Water Temperature
    34.80,                              !- Reference Leaving Condenser Water Temperature
    autosize,                           !- Reference Chilled Water Flow Rate
    0.02797,                            !- Reference Condenser Water Flow Rate
    ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes CAPFT,!- Cooling Capacity Function of Temperature Curve Name
    ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes EIRFT,!- Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Temperature Curve Name
    LeavingCondenserWaterTemperature,   !- Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Part Load Ratio Curve Type
    ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes EIRFPLR,!- Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Part Load Ratio Curve Name
    0.29,                               !- Minimum Part Load Ratio
    1.02,                               !- Maximum Part Load Ratio
    1.0,                                !- Optimum Part Load Ratio
    0.29,                               !- Minimum Unloading Ratio
    Chiller 2 CHW Inlet,                !- Chilled Water Inlet Node Name
    Chiller 2 CHW Outlet,               !- Chilled Water Outlet Node Name
    Chiller 2 CW Inlet,                 !- Condenser Inlet Node Name
    Chiller 2 CW Outlet,                !- Condenser Outlet Node Name
    1.0,                                !- Fraction of Compressor Electric Consumption Rejected by Condenser
    2.0,                                !- Leaving Chilled Water Lower Temperature Limit
    LeavingSetpointModulated,           !- Chiller Flow Mode Type
    0,                                  !- Design Heat Recovery Water Flow Rate
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Inlet Node Name
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Outlet Node Name
    0.5,                                !- Sizing Factor
    ,                                   !- Condenser Heat Recovery Relative Capacity Fraction
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Inlet High Temperature Limit Schedule Name
    ,                                   !- Heat Recovery Leaving Temperature Setpoint Node Name
    Chillers;                           !- End-Use Subcategory

  Chiller:Electric:ReformulatedEIR,
    Chiller 3,                          !- Name
    552000,                             !- Reference Capacity
    5.38,                               !- Reference COP
    6.11,                               !- Reference Leaving Chilled Water Temperature
    34.80,                              !- Reference Leaving Condenser Water Temperature
    autosize,                           !- Reference Chilled Water Flow Rate
    0.02797,                            !- Reference Condenser Water Flow Rate
    ReformEIRChiller Trane CVHE 1329kW/5.38COP/Vanes CAPFT,!- Cooling Capacity Function of Temperature Curve Name
